(Staindel).</NOTE> , pro sororis vel
fratris filia <NOTE N="(169)" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="1356" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1356B"></COL> Germani tantum, sed, quod ad Rixam attinet,
certissimi.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Thietmar</HI>  p. 100;  <HI REND="ITALIC">Chronogr. Saxo</HI> 
